WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.900
A reader has a question.

2
00:00:03.551 --> 00:00:06.991
The answer comes from your docs, with a link to the exact section.

3
00:00:10.821 --> 00:00:12.421
It's built with Markdrop Guides.

4
00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:14.061
Here's how it comes together.

5
00:00:15.555 --> 00:00:18.135
Start blank, from a template, or bring what you have.

6
00:00:19.022 --> 00:00:20.562
Paste your GitBook site's address.

7
00:00:21.082 --> 00:00:24.482
Pages, images, navigation and old links come across.

8
00:00:27.297 --> 00:00:29.197
Nothing is public until you publish.

9
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:33.686
Writing feels like a document.

10
00:00:35.058 --> 00:00:38.078
Select a passage, and ask AI to tighten it.

11
00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:40.478
You see the suggestion before you accept it.

12
00:00:43.477 --> 00:00:45.917
Find and replace works across the page.

13
00:00:46.317 --> 00:00:49.097
And checks catch a broken link before your readers do.

14
00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.830
Pick one of fourteen themes, or match your brand.

15
00:00:59.554 --> 00:01:03.754
Add your logo, and the colours follow, checked for contrast in light and dark.

16
00:01:07.663 --> 00:01:10.503
When it's ready, see exactly what changed, then publish.

17
00:01:15.071 --> 00:01:18.691
About a minute later, it's live at its own address, on every screen.

18
00:01:22.083 --> 00:01:25.283
Readers get fast search, and answers that link to the source.

19
00:01:27.811 --> 00:01:29.731
One tap tells you whether a page helped.

20
00:01:32.638 --> 00:01:37.275
Add an OpenAPI file, and you get an API reference, with Try it.

21
00:01:38.975 --> 00:01:41.475
Readers call your API right from the page.

22
00:01:41.975 --> 00:01:44.210
Their keys never pass through Markdrop.

23
00:01:47.010 --> 00:01:50.290
Insights shows what readers search for, and what they couldn't find.

24
00:01:52.623 --> 00:01:54.503
One click starts the page that's missing.

25
00:01:59.535 --> 00:02:03.115
And when you're ready, put it on your own domain, with one DNS record.

26
00:02:07.769 --> 00:02:08.569
Markdrop Guides.

27
00:02:08.589 --> 00:02:12.705
Free while in beta, at markdrop.in/guides.
